        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/modern-warfare-4-price-parry-prompt-header.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>I, for my sins, enjoy parry mechanics. I use 'parry slop' lovingly as a shorthand to refer to action games I want to play which feature parrying as a predominant mechanic. I am also a Call of Duty campaign enjoyer, and those games rarely feature any melee combat, let alone something as advanced as parrying. So, to say I was genuinely surprised to see Modern Warfare 4 bring the two together would be an understatement.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-parry-melee-best-moments\">Read more</a></p>",
